                                        "entry_id": "164c8979-e3c1-3511-929a-f80287f6d2f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The milky sap of several trees that coagulates on exposure to air; used to make rubber."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
